{"unit_id": "MarchLiu__dsh-graft#feature-1", "repo": "MarchLiu/dsh-graft", "commit": "73f080531fe70438eedcf15c8dd3bdffe42486c1", "type": "feature", "lang": "zh", "text": "dsh-graft 的功能「从会话记录筛选并预览」：按会话 ID 或无歧义前缀读取日志，可限定序号范围、角色、关键词和末尾条数，并将消息整理成可读 transcript。", "source": "generated", "evidence": ["index.js:277"]}
