{"unit_id": "MarchLiu__dsh-graft#caveat-1", "repo": "MarchLiu/dsh-graft", "commit": "73f080531fe70438eedcf15c8dd3bdffe42486c1", "type": "caveat", "lang": "zh", "text": "dsh-graft 使用前须知：网页端嫁接范围受浏览器已加载的历史窗口限制，尚未加载的早期轮次不会包含在发送内容中。（见 README.md:21）", "source": "generated", "evidence": ["README.md:21"]}
